& [SemanticRefinementTrace] resolves ambiguous source terms
  + [content_read] is renamed semantically to caller-designated identity and does not assert a read occurred
  + [stable] is restricted to exact comparison under the prerequisite supplied-value profile
  + [content] is restricted to accepted caller-supplied byte concatenation
  + [binding] is structural association, not causal or provenance proof
  + [hash] is SHA-256 digest derivation, not a lookup-table identity or signature

